.mcp-cli
# dist/ IS committed on this branch — see FORK.md. Installs come from a git URL and
# `ignore-scripts=true` (standard hardening) blocks the `prepare` build, so a prebuilt
# dist is what makes `npx git+https://…` work at all. The entra-resource-fix branch,
# which is what gets offered upstream, keeps dist ignored.
